    3. For each region that will contain yellow, place 1-2 yellow pixels at their OUTPUT (slid) positions -- against the far wall in the slide direction
    4. Derive INPUT by reverse-sliding each yellow 1-6 steps opposite the direction, ensuring the path is clear inside the region
    5. Verify no legend/wall overlap, all regions fully enclosed, and slide distances >= 1
